     "statusKey": "concept",
     "kicker": "Independent concept project · Merani",
     "text": "An independent sculptural concept inspired by Nikoloz Baratashvili’s poem “Merani”. The horse becomes an image of freedom, sacrifice and the courage to open an untrodden path. Original concept and hand-sculpted model by Miranda Kuprava.",
