     "title": "From One Root, Every Future",
     "statusKey": "concept",
     "kicker": "Independent concept project · mobility sculpture",
     "text": "The tree becomes a spatial metaphor for movement and evolution: root as origin and energy, a central spine as intelligence, spiral roads as mobility, orbital nodes as transition, and upper air space where movement becomes three-dimensional. Road → intelligence → physical AI → flight.",
